WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.879
Six point five million Canadians have no family doctor.

00:00:03.829 --> 00:00:08.454
The median wait for a specialist appointment is twenty-seven point seven weeks.

00:00:08.454 --> 00:00:13.409
Approximately thirty percent of emergency room visits exceed clinical benchmarks.

00:00:13.409 --> 00:00:17.727
Twenty-three thousand nursing vacancies remain unfilled nationwide.

00:00:17.727 --> 00:00:22.215
Hip replacement: thirty-nine weeks median wait against a target of twelve.

00:00:22.215 --> 00:00:26.431
Knee replacement: forty-two weeks against the same twelve-week target.

00:00:26.431 --> 00:00:33.409
The federal share of health spending has fallen to approximately twenty-two percent — down from fifty percent when Medicare was founded.

00:00:33.409 --> 00:00:39.329
The Canada Health Transfer for 2024-25 is fifty-two point one billion dollars.

00:00:39.329 --> 00:00:42.386
The system is not underfunded by accident.

00:00:42.386 --> 00:00:44.749
It is underfunded by design.
